    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609930/extras/e17c2908edb9e183a8ef74fd775eeeb8.avif?t=1753555212\" width=512 height=194 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reelease is a video player application exclusively for Steam and SteamVR.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch your favorite videos right from your USB or HDD.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can watch videos in 2D, 3D, 180\u00b0, 360\u00b0 and Anaglyph.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- No accounts needed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- No subscriptions needed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- No hassles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watching videos has been made real easy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reelease supports video formats of .mp4, .mov, .avi. and .webm. You can watch videos in 2D, 3D, 180\u00b0, 360\u00b0 and Anaglyph.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick and easy to navigate menu system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >View videos within 8 different scenarios on a giant projection screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from multiple screen border neon colors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch from an adjustable view distance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn on / off screen emitting light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn on / off scene ambient sound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the width of the screen from the equivalent of watching 16:9 or 2.4:1.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide the screen if wanting to just look at the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize the look of various scenes to display your own posters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own video thumbnail images.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn on / off subtitles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from multiple menu artwork backgrounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from multiple pointer models.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch videos on a flat or curved projection screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your own paths to your videos and custom content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change visual quality settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with various objects within the environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609930/extras/e17c2908edb9e183a8ef74fd775eeeb8.avif?t=1753555212\" width=512 height=194 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reelease is a video player application exclusively for Steam and SteamVR.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch your favorite videos right from your USB or HDD.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can watch videos in 2D, 3D, 180\u00b0, 360\u00b0 and Anaglyph.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- No accounts needed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- No subscriptions needed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- No hassles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watching videos has been made real easy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reelease supports video formats of .mp4, .mov, .avi. and .webm. You can watch videos in 2D, 3D, 180\u00b0, 360\u00b0 and Anaglyph.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick and easy to navigate menu system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >View videos within 8 different scenarios on a giant projection screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from multiple screen border neon colors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch from an adjustable view distance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn on / off screen emitting light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn on / off scene ambient sound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the width of the screen from the equivalent of watching 16:9 or 2.4:1.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide the screen if wanting to just look at the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize the look of various scenes to display your own posters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own video thumbnail images.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn on / off subtitles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from multiple menu artwork backgrounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from multiple pointer models.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch videos on a flat or curved projection screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your own paths to your videos and custom content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change visual quality settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with various objects within the environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
